 `internal/config/config.go` is plumbed into service config, but the reopened review found the existing routing bypass only covered provider/harness pins. Exact `Model` pins must also override provider `include_by_default: false`; otherwise an operator can request a known model and still have its provider removed from eligibility.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;CURRENT STATE\u0026#xA;The original implementation landed in commit `cc2fadf187a77b4bcc78480469acc60a68646df6`, then this bead was reopened with note: \u0026#34;include_by_default bypass only checks Provider/Harness pins, but FEAT/CONTRACT hard pins include exact Model. Add model-only pin behavior and tests.\u0026#34;\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;PROPOSED FIX\u0026#xA;In the routing eligibility path, keep excluding `IncludeByDefault: false` providers from unpinned/default routing, but treat any explicit hard pin on `Harness`, `Provider`, or exact `Model` as intentional and allow that provider to remain eligible when the pin resolves to it. Preserve route-status evidence for default-route exclusions.\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;IN-SCOPE FILES\u0026#xA;- `internal/routing/` eligibility/filter code and tests\u0026#xA;- `internal/config/` tests only if additional config fixture coverage is needed\u0026#xA;- `agentcli/` route-status tests only if surfaced output changes\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;NON-SCOPE\u0026#xA;- Catalog-level `IncludeByDefault` defaults\u0026#xA;- Quota-aware routing\u0026#xA;- Per-model `ExactPinOnly` behavior unrelated to provider default inclusion\n    \u003c/description\u003e\n    \u003cacceptance\u003e\n1. `go test ./internal/routing/... ./internal/config/... -run \u0026#39;IncludeByDefault|Pin|Model\u0026#39; -count=1` passes and includes regression coverage for default-route exclusion, explicit provider pin bypass, and exact model pin bypass.\u0026#xA;2. `go test ./agentcli/... -run \u0026#39;RouteStatus|IncludeByDefault|Pin|Model\u0026#39; -count=1` passes, or `go test ./agentcli/... -count=1` passes if no route-status implementation change is needed.\u0026#xA;3. `go vet ./...` passes.\n    \u003c/acceptance\u003e\n    \u003cnotes\u003e\nReview 2026-05-12: include_by_default bypass only checks Provider/Harness pins, but FEAT/CONTRACT hard pins include exact Model. Add model-only pin behavior and tests.\n    \u003c/notes\u003e\n    \u003clabels\u003earea:routing, area:config, kind:bug, phase:implementation\u003c/labels\u003e\n    \u003cmetadata spec-id=\"ADR-006\" base-rev=\"4f0ee150f93be6c21ced5b72b9e4df2e412671a9\" bundle=\".ddx/executions/20260512T181453-5c79127d\"/\u003e\n  \u003c/bead\u003e\n  \u003cgoverning\u003e\n    \u003cref id=\"ADR-006\" path=\"docs/helix/02-design/adr/ADR-006-overrides-as-routing-failure-signals.md\"\u003eADR-006: Manual Overrides Are Auto-Routing Failure Signals\u003c/ref\u003e\n  \u003c/governing\u003e\n\u003c/execute-bead\u003e\n","metadata":{"DDX_MODE":"bead_execution","attempt_id":"20260512T181453-5c79127d","base_rev":"4f0ee150f93be6c21ced5b72b9e4df2e412671a9","bead_id":"fizeau-d18e11f5","bundle_path":".ddx/executions/20260512T181453-5c79127d","correlation_id":"fizeau-d18e11f5:20260512T181453-5c79127d","prompt_file":".ddx/executions/20260512T181453-5c79127d/prompt.md","prompt_sha":"b3e94801dc78f8063912841b45f5f03386273b209dd24ae4e94ef99956e32cec","role":"implementer","session_id":"eb-f2846860","worker_id":""}}}
